Don't worry.

304
00:24:56,700 --> 00:24:57,420
It won't.

305
00:24:57,779 --> 00:24:58,539
Don't be afraid.

306
00:25:00,079 --> 00:25:01,119
It will all pass.

307
00:25:02,119 --> 00:25:03,539
Mom, let me do it. Let me.

308
00:25:03,900 --> 00:25:05,380
I'll go make Huanhuan's formula now.

309
00:25:05,519 --> 00:25:06,240
Okay, okay.

310
