314
00:27:15,059 --> 00:27:16,539
Unit 8, Room 201?

315
00:27:16,579 --> 00:27:17,819
Right. 201. 201.

316
00:27:19,319 --> 00:27:20,460
Yes, it's available.

317
00:27:22,779 --> 00:27:23,619
Thank you.

318
00:27:23,799 --> 00:27:25,019
