344
00:29:46,980 --> 00:29:48,059
I deserve it.

345
00:29:48,680 --> 00:29:50,019
I deserve it.

346
00:29:53,980 --> 00:29:54,819
Dr. Ma,

347
00:29:56,720 --> 00:29:58,019
Dr. Ma, you know what?

348
00:29:59,180 --> 00:30:01,339
I feel completely worthless right now.

349
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:02,559
You... you shouldn't think like that.

350
00:30:02,559 --> 00:30:04,420
