371
00:31:44,319 --> 00:31:46,299
I understand you.

372
00:31:47,420 --> 00:31:48,299
Understand.

373
00:31:49,980 --> 00:31:50,859
Thank you.

374
00:31:51,359 --> 00:31:53,099
No, no, no. No.

375
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,480
