447
00:37:56,219 --> 00:37:57,199
Come back right now.

448
00:37:57,800 --> 00:37:59,340
I just saw someone outside the window.

449
00:37:59,639 --> 00:38:01,340
He's... in our yard.

450
00:38:01,639 --> 00:38:03,340
I'm heading home right now.

451
00:38:03,420 --> 00:38:04,619
Don't scare yourself.

452
00:38:36,059 --> 00:38:36,780
Welcome home.

453
00:38:36,780 --> 00:38:37,460
Tingting,

454
00:38:38,539 --> 00:38:39,320
