457
00:38:55,639 --> 00:38:56,300
Ma Du.

458
00:38:58,219 --> 00:38:59,900
You can tell me anything.

459
00:39:02,179 --> 00:39:03,219
It's nothing.

460
00:39:10,420 --> 00:39:11,719
Alright, alright, stop obsessing.

461
00:39:11,800 --> 00:39:12,780
