495
00:41:37,460 --> 00:41:39,059
Wait... Tingting, Tingting, Tingting!

496
00:41:39,059 --> 00:41:40,420
Listen to me! Listen to me!

497
00:41:40,539 --> 00:41:41,500
Believe me.

498
00:41:43,019 --> 00:41:44,739
She will definitely wake up.

499
00:41:44,860 --> 00:41:47,239
When she wakes up, I'll explain everything to her.

500
00:41:47,900 --> 00:41:50,139
I'll tell her it was all an accident.

501
00:41:50,619 --> 00:41:51,880
I'll go talk to her.

502
