513
00:42:28,719 --> 00:42:29,320
Then...

514
00:42:30,599 --> 00:42:33,780
Then what do you expect me to do?

515
00:42:38,059 --> 00:42:39,500
Why is it that some people

516
00:42:39,760 --> 00:42:42,579
Have everything the moment they open their eyes?

517
00:42:42,920 --> 00:42:44,420
Studying abroad,

518
00:42:45,000 --> 00:42:46,659
Traveling the world,

519
00:42:46,960 --> 00:42:48,539
Cars, houses...

520
00:42:49,099 --> 00:42:51,300
All handed to them on a silver platter!

521
00:42:51,619 --> 00:42:53,260
And me?

522
00:42:55,579 --> 00:42:58,260
I've worked my ass off just to survive.

523
00:42:58,440 --> 00:43:01,139
I studied like my life depended on it.

524
00:43:01,260 --> 00:43:03,420
To learn, to get my credentials,

525
00:43:03,420 --> 00:43:05,900
To take the grad exams, to write papers.

526
00:43:06,800 --> 00:43:10,139
