527
00:43:10,300 --> 00:43:12,059
Living in constant fear

528
00:43:12,659 --> 00:43:15,179
Just to save every penny.

529
00:43:17,780 --> 00:43:21,059
I fought for fifteen years.

530
00:43:24,139 --> 00:43:25,820
Fifteen years!

531
00:43:27,179 --> 00:43:30,059
Just to build this home for us.

532
00:43:30,619 --> 00:43:31,659
And then...

533
00:43:31,980 --> 00:43:34,059
One tiny mistake...

534
00:43:34,539 --> 00:43:38,820
