What am I supposed to do?

538
00:43:49,059 --> 00:43:50,760
What am I supposed to do?!

539
00:43:51,920 --> 00:43:53,719
What do I do?!

540
00:44:00,039 --> 00:44:01,760
I just...

541
00:44:02,880 --> 00:44:05,000
Wanted our child

542
00:44:05,780 --> 00:44:09,119
To grow up in a normal family.

543
00:44:20,960 --> 00:44:22,119
I know.

544
00:44:31,300 --> 00:44:31,880
It's fine.

545
00:44:32,099 --> 00:44:32,960
Leave this to me.

546
00:44:33,039 --> 00:44:34,000
You go ahead to work.

547
00:44:34,599 --> 00:44:36,360
I'm sorry, Tingting.

548
00:44:37,340 --> 00:44:38,199
Thank you.

549
00:44:44,900 --> 00:44:46,119
Let me go over

550
