556
00:45:10,139 --> 00:45:11,679
Remember what you said.

557
00:45:13,300 --> 00:45:14,119
Don't be afraid.

558
00:45:15,980 --> 00:45:17,159
It'll all pass.

559
00:45:19,460 --> 00:45:20,400
It will pass.

560
00:46:00,860 --> 00:46:01,920
