00:46:17,159 --> 00:46:18,079
to contact Ms. Bai,

570
00:46:18,159 --> 00:46:20,000
but her phone has been unreachable.

571
00:46:20,059 --> 00:46:21,139
We want to remind her

572
00:46:21,219 --> 00:46:23,219
that she has a whole life insurance policy

573
00:46:23,300 --> 00:46:24,179
with an overdue premium.

574
00:46:24,219 --> 00:46:25,940
The payment needs to be processed as soon as possible.

575
00:46:30,539 --> 00:46:32,699
How come I didn't know she bought this insurance?

576
00:46:33,039 --> 00:46:33,960
How many years?

577
00:46:36,000 --> 00:46:36,639
According to our records,

578
00:46:36,699 --> 00:46:38,099
she took out the policy five years ago.

579
00:46:38,179 --> 00:46:39,280
Premiums are paid annually.

580
00:46:39,360 --> 00:46:40,340
If it remains unpaid,

581
00:46:40,340 --> 00:46:41,599
the policy will lapse.

582
00:46:42,000 --> 00:46:42,860
Hold on a second.

583
00:46:43,119 --> 00:46:44,280
Five years ago?

584
00:46:46,059 --> 00:46:47,460
What's the total amount of the policy?

585
00:46:47,539 --> 00:46:48,460
If it's convenient for you,

586
00:46:48,500 --> 00:46:50,179
you should come to our branch in person.

587
00:46:50,219 --> 00:46:52,380
Our manager will explain it to you personally.

588
00:46:54,079 --> 00:46:55,719
Alright, send me the address.

589
00:48:49,219 --> 00:48:50,199
Is this the room?

590
00:48:50,320 --> 00:48:51,119
Yes, this one.

591
00:48:53,960 --> 00:48:55,559
You need to get proof from the management office first.

592
00:48:55,659 --> 00:48:56,760
It's a rule in our line of work.

593
00:49:00,820 --> 00:49:02,320
Here, I'll throw in an extra bill.

594
00:49:02,519 --> 00:49:03,719
Hurry up and open the door. It's an emergency.

595
00:49:03,820 --> 00:49:05,039
Are you really the owner?

596
00:49:05,760 --> 00:49:07,280
Let me see your ID and the property deed.

597
00:49:07,500 --> 00:49:09,679
They're locked inside. How am I supposed to show you?

598
00:49:10,699 --> 00:49:11,500
The management office knows me.

599
00:49:11,559 --> 00:49:12,519
Just open it, hurry!

600
00:49:13,800 --> 00:49:15,239
Then give the management a call right now.

601
00:49:15,320 --> 00:49:16,119
Just to confirm.

602
00:49:17,139 --> 00:49:18,639
Why are you being so difficult?

603
00:49:19,559 --> 00:49:20,440
Here, here, I'll pay you even more.

604
00:49:20,480 --> 00:49:21,360
Hurry. Just open it!

605
00:49:21,559 --> 00:49:22,159
Quick!

606
00:49:22,380 --> 00:49:23,519
The more money you offer, the sketchier this feels.

607
00:49:23,519 --> 00:49:25,159
Someone just got fined 5,000 last month.

608
00:49:26,860 --> 00:49:28,119
Wait, wait, wait! Don't go!

609
00:49:28,480 --> 00:49:29,519
I really have an emergency.

610
00:49:29,880 --> 00:49:30,960
Something might have happened to my wife.

611
00:49:30,960 --> 00:49:32,239
I can't find her anywhere.

612
00:49:32,519 --> 00:49:34,159
Can you please just help me open the door?

613
00:49:34,260 --> 00:49:35,440
If it's a real emergency, call the police.

614
00:49:35,559 --> 00:49:36,719
I'll open it as soon as the police get here.

615
00:49:36,780 --> 00:49:37,400
Alright?

616
00:49:39,119 --> 00:49:40,000
Psycho.

617
00:49:45,539 --> 00:49:47,400
The principal amount up to now...

618
00:49:47,500 --> 00:49:50,119
...has accumulated into a considerable sum.

619
00:49:50,599 --> 00:49:52,820
If this year's premium of 300,000...

620
00:49:52,920 --> 00:49:54,260
...isn't paid,

621
00:49:54,380 --> 00:49:57,420
...you'll lose all coverage moving forward.

622
00:49:57,559 --> 00:49:59,860
That would be a huge loss.

623
00:50:00,440 --> 00:50:01,739
I already told you.

624
00:50:01,800 --> 00:50:03,099
I can't find my wife right now.

625
00:50:03,179 --> 00:50:04,340
I don't have any spare cash on hand.

626
00:50:04,400 --> 00:50:05,480
Do you understand?

627
00:50:05,579 --> 00:50:08,059
I can apply for a payment extension for you.

628
00:50:08,159 --> 00:50:09,079
How does that sound?

629
00:50:09,159 --> 00:50:11,019
Stop your rambling.

630
00:50:11,280 --> 00:50:12,519
Just answer my question.

631
00:50:13,039 --> 00:50:15,360
What happens if I can't renew it?

632
00:50:16,099 --> 00:50:18,079
Then you only get the principal back.

633
00:50:18,320 --> 00:50:19,579
300,000 a year.

634
00:50:19,659 --> 00:50:21,159
You can do the math for five years.

635
00:50:21,360 --> 00:50:22,800
If you cancel the contract now...

636
00:50:22,920 --> 00:50:25,320
...you'll lose another 30% of the principal.

637
00:50:32,400 --> 00:50:33,320
Thank you.

638
00:50:53,480 --> 00:50:54,039
Wait.

639
00:50:58,059 --> 00:50:59,920
Stop running. I need to ask you something.

640
00:51:00,039 --> 00:51:01,940
I have an emergency at home. We'll talk later.

641
00:51:02,000 --> 00:51:04,019
You misunderstood. I'm not here to arrest you.

642
00:51:06,559 --> 00:51:08,000
Let me explain.

643
00:51:08,280 --> 00:51:09,920
There's nothing to explain.

644
00:51:10,039 --> 00:51:12,000
Let's just end this, okay?

645
00:51:14,099 --> 00:51:15,719
If we keep going on like this,

646
00:51:16,440 --> 00:51:18,679
it won't lead anywhere.

647
00:51:19,079 --> 00:51:21,239
Then let's break up.

648
00:51:41,579 --> 00:51:42,400
Stop!

649
00:51:42,739 --> 00:51:44,480
Stop right there! Stop!

650
00:51:45,139 --> 00:51:46,119
Stop running!

651
00:51:47,780 --> 00:51:48,559
Damn it!

652
00:51:55,360 --> 00:51:56,280
Stop running!

653
00:51:59,519 --> 00:52:00,480
Stop running!

654
00:52:06,000 --> 00:52:06,639
I...

655
00:52:07,820 --> 00:52:08,599
Stop!

656
00:52:10,440 --> 00:52:11,199
Stop!

657
00:52:12,519 --> 00:52:13,440
Stop!

658
00:52:21,500 --> 00:52:22,639
Just arrest me.

659
00:52:24,400 --> 00:52:26,119
I only stole two phones.

660
00:52:26,179 --> 00:52:28,000
Your bike isn't worth much anyway.

661
00:52:28,139 --> 00:52:28,920
Take them all.

662
00:52:33,920 --> 00:52:35,840
Is that all you've got?

663
00:52:37,820 --> 00:52:38,840
I'm right here!

664
00:52:38,900 --> 00:52:40,559
I'm standing right here!

665
00:52:41,559 --> 00:52:42,480
I...

666
00:52:42,840 --> 00:52:44,559
Wan Fenqi.

667
00:52:55,320 --> 00:52:56,239
No, no, no.

668
00:52:58,960 --> 00:53:00,360
Bro, I'll give you whatever you want.

669
00:53:05,360 --> 00:53:06,719
Can you pick a security door?

670
00:53:11,579 --> 00:53:13,239
This isn't even a security door.

671
00:53:13,360 --> 00:53:14,519
It's just a standard lock.

672
00:53:14,659 --> 00:53:15,400
It's easy.

673
00:53:23,699 --> 00:53:24,800
Bro, what's this?

674
00:53:25,099 --> 00:53:26,159
Payment for picking the lock.

675
00:53:34,260 --> 00:53:35,039
What are you doing?

676
00:53:35,179 --> 00:53:36,599
I saw a movie once.

677
00:53:38,139 --> 00:53:39,380
Taking off the mask at the end

678
00:53:39,380 --> 00:53:41,119
is the ultimate sign of respect.

679
00:53:41,800 --> 00:53:43,239
Thanks for the lesson, bro.

680
00:53:43,639 --> 00:53:45,559
I'll make an honest living from now on.

681
00:53:48,460 --> 00:53:49,059
Get out.

682
00:54:58,340 --> 00:54:59,659
Welcome home.

683
00:55:02,619 --> 00:55:03,860
Where did she go?

684
00:55:05,059 --> 00:55:07,059
Don't panic. She couldn't have gone far.

685
00:55:08,119 --> 00:55:09,659
I'll check the East Gate, you check the West Gate.

686
00:55:09,900 --> 00:55:10,539
Okay.

687
00:55:23,420 --> 00:55:24,559
If it's a real emergency, call 110.

688
00:55:24,639 --> 00:55:25,880
I'll open up as soon as the police arrive.

689
00:55:45,079 --> 00:55:46,840
You're the only one they listen to.

690
00:55:46,900 --> 00:55:48,280
They don't listen to us at all.

691
00:55:49,199 --> 00:55:50,039
How are you feeling?

692
00:55:50,199 --> 00:55:51,400
Did you sleep well last night?

693
00:55:51,940 --> 00:55:53,039
I slept okay.

694
00:55:53,179 --> 00:55:55,320
Just felt a bit short of breath after midnight.

695
00:55:56,119 --> 00:55:56,920
I checked.

696
00:55:57,039 --> 00:55:58,199
Around 2:00 a.m.,

697
00:55:58,280 --> 00:55:59,880
your blood oxygen dropped to 92.

698
00:56:00,219 --> 00:56:02,199
Probably some blood buildup in the drainage tube.

699
00:56:05,599 --> 00:56:06,440
Relax.

700
00:56:07,039 --> 00:56:07,800
Take a deep breath.

701
00:56:09,480 --> 00:56:10,920
Wan Fenqi found out about Room 201.

702
00:56:11,000 --> 00:56:12,559
From inside, I heard him asking for a locksmith.

703
00:56:12,679 --> 00:56:13,880
Good thing they refused to open the door for him.

704
00:56:16,039 --> 00:56:17,119
Where is he now?

705
00:56:17,219 --> 00:56:18,400
He took a call and left.

706
00:56:18,579 --> 00:56:19,699
I saw him heading to the parking garage.

707
00:56:19,940 --> 00:56:20,500
I suspect

708
00:56:20,579 --> 00:56:21,920
he went to find someone else to pick the lock.

709
00:56:22,400 --> 00:56:23,480
You need to come back right now.

710
00:56:24,320 --> 00:56:25,320
Can you come back now?

711
00:56:25,500 --> 00:56:26,300
Listen to me.

712
00:56:26,539 --> 00:56:27,719
Keep an eye on him for now.

713
00:56:27,800 --> 00:56:28,440
I'll be right there.

714
00:56:28,519 --> 00:56:30,159
I'll excuse myself and head back.

715
00:56:37,800 --> 00:56:39,119
Xiao Yang told me everything.

716
00:56:39,900 --> 00:56:41,260
There's a situation with your family.

717
00:56:41,619 --> 00:56:42,679
Why didn't you say anything?

718
00:56:44,940 --> 00:56:45,840
It's nothing, Director.

719
00:56:46,000 --> 00:56:47,960
It's really not that serious.

720
00:56:47,960 --> 00:56:48,679
Look, just...

721
00:56:48,820 --> 00:56:50,639
hurry and bring them to the hospital.

722
00:56:50,860 --> 00:56:52,079
Once things happen,

723
00:56:52,420 --> 00:56:53,480
you have to face them eventually.

724
00:56:54,820 --> 00:56:56,000
Go back and get things sorted.

725
00:56:56,820 --> 00:56:57,760
Understood, Director.

726
00:56:59,079 --> 00:57:00,000
Thank you, Director.

727
00:57:17,500 --> 00:57:18,179
Tingting

728
00:57:27,159 --> 00:57:28,380
We need to move her right away.

729
00:57:28,820 --> 00:57:29,780
Where to?

730
00:57:33,219 --> 00:57:35,019
Careful, she's injured.

731
00:58:23,000 --> 00:58:25,000
Looks like there's not much left in the fridge.

732
00:58:26,119 --> 00:58:27,599
I've been so busy the last few days.

733
00:58:28,599 --> 00:58:30,000
I completely forgot to buy groceries.

734
00:58:31,380 --> 00:58:33,800
As long as you haven't forgotten who used to cook.

735
00:58:52,960 --> 00:58:54,199
Do you still remember those days?

736
00:58:55,159 --> 00:58:56,480
The food street was right outside our window.

737
00:58:58,159 --> 00:58:59,599
Whatever smell drifted in from outside,

738
00:59:00,019 --> 00:59:01,079
we'd use that scent

739
00:59:01,139 --> 00:59:02,199
to name our noodles.

740
00:59:02,900 --> 00:59:03,699
Yeah, I remember.

741
00:59:04,159 --> 00:59:06,079
Like Thirteen-Spice Yangchun Noodles,

742
00:59:06,920 --> 00:59:08,199
Durian Yangchun Noodles,

743
00:59:09,579 --> 00:59:11,280
and Jun's Hairstyle Yangchun Noodles.

744
00:59:14,199 --> 00:59:15,199
Don't bring that up.

745
00:59:15,360 --> 00:59:17,320
Just mentioning it makes me taste hairspray.

746
00:59:18,440 --> 00:59:19,880
I actually ran into him the other day.

747
00:59:20,980 --> 00:59:21,880
Jun asked me

748
00:59:22,820 --> 00:59:24,960
why I haven't come in for a haircut in so long.

749
00:59:25,800 --> 00:59:27,039
I told him he was so fake.

750
00:59:27,980 --> 00:59:29,760
We moved out over a year ago.

751
00:59:31,539 --> 00:59:32,639
Thinking about it now,

752
00:59:34,659 --> 00:59:36,800
those days had their good moments too.

753
00:59:37,900 --> 00:59:38,960
You think they were good

754
00:59:39,699 --> 00:59:41,519
because we've already moved past them.

755
00:59:41,699 --> 00:59:43,159
The path remains the same.

756
00:59:44,380 --> 00:59:45,519
How we walk it

757
00:59:46,199 --> 00:59:47,519
is what we should be thinking about.

758
00:59:57,480 --> 00:59:58,559
Does she need another IV drip?

759
00:59:59,440 --> 01:00:00,320
One more bottle.

760
01:00:01,199 --> 01:00:02,519
Her blood count is still a bit high.

761
01:00:02,639 --> 01:00:04,400
Once this drip is done, you can wipe her down.

762
01:00:04,440 --> 01:00:05,079
Okay.

763
01:00:09,019 --> 01:00:09,679
Let's go.

764
01:00:46,539 --> 01:00:47,739
Where did she go?

765
01:00:47,940 --> 01:00:49,659
Don't panic. She couldn't have gone far.

766
01:00:49,760 --> 01:00:51,280
I'll check the East Gate, you check the West Gate.

767
01:00:51,380 --> 01:00:52,000
Okay.
